    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Initiation 1 — True-Name Touch.</strong> The Resonance Pool comes online (existing class resource — see your Doctrine for generation rule). When you spend Clarity to manifest, you may <em>name</em> the target as part of the action. For the rest of the scene, extending that manifestation's Reach to the named target costs 1 less Surge / Blood Debt (minimum 0).</p><p><span style=\"opacity: 0.7; font-size: 0.85em\">Discipline (passive): Reach discount −1 on Blood-Debt-reach. Skill rank +1 in two of: Occult, Lore, Insight, Lore.</span></p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"clInit1\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\"><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #d4b8e8; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.78rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>True-Name Touch</strong></span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.92; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 0.86rem\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> At-will (per scene)  ·  <strong>Action:</strong> Bonus (with manifestation)  ·  <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.82rem\">Name a target as part of your manifestation. For the rest of the scene, extending that manifestation's Reach to the named target costs 1 less Surge (min 0).</span></p></div>",
